00:36:52.180 --> 00:36:54.660
Um, so, not really worth getting into.

00:36:55.280 --> 00:37:01.940
Um, but what I'll say about this game is it's preposterous to even suggest this might be on

00:37:01.940 --> 00:37:02.920
the essential games list.

