And it's, uh, I don't know.

00:37:21.180 --> 00:37:22.260
It's having fun with it.

00:37:22.340 --> 00:37:26.140
Whereas the other ones I felt were kind of the worst.

00:37:26.140 --> 00:37:31.180
Worst, I, maybe, maybe I don't say that on those episodes, but right now, thinking back,

