see how we do it all of them.

00:37:58.020 --> 00:37:59.400
Um, but yeah.

00:37:59.600 --> 00:38:02.260
No, not essential. Uh, yeah.

00:38:02.620 --> 00:38:10.680
Joe? I also had more fun with this game than I think I usually do with these track and field style

00:38:10.680 --> 00:38:13.920
games. And, but I didn't have that much fun with this game.

00:38:14.120 --> 00:38:18.200
So, like, I think that tells you where I stand with this style game in general.

00:38:18.660 --> 00:38:23.060
Like, I, I, I agree with you, Sean, that I think that, like, the, I think that what this

00:38:23.060 --> 00:38:28.720
game, everything good about this game to me is, like, about the presentation and the,

00:38:28.720 --> 00:38:30.700
the, the humor that it has.

